   "verdict": "confirmed",
   "confidence": "medium",
   "support": [
    {
     "source": "s3",
     "quote": "The first creation account is divided into seven days during which God creates light (day 1); the sky (day 2); the Earth, seas, and vegetation (day 3); the Sun and Moon (day 4); animals of the air and sea (day 5); and land animals and humans (day 6).",
